                "meaning": "may; can",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "c35e930c1ba4cd1f23e25f38f1543c3a96ee8db1764dd6d4188bcf2c506fd3f8"
              },
              {
                "text": "如果",
                "pinyin": "rúguǒ",
                "meaning": "if; in case",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "8ad48f7b735c7260a44386309154c7eda893578385dcc04562c0a4764842a730"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "A partner asks you to go together tomorrow. You are willing to go, but can go only if you have free time. Your free time has not been confirmed. Propose the conditional plan without saying it is already certain.\nFamiliar meanings available: be willing to; may; can; if; in case."
          }
